  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design support gender institutions with J&#xe4;My</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Designst&#xf6;d j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsinstitutioner tillsammans med J&#xe4;My</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r ett designst&#xf6;d, dvs ett mindre st&#xf6;d till svenska J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsmyndigheten f&#xf6;r att de tillsammans med sin systermyndighet i Bosnien och Hercegovina ska designa ett nytt program. M&#xe5;let med designst&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att etablera och hitta former f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rdjupat samarbete mellan svenska J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsmyndigheten och dess motsvarigheter i Bosnien och Hercegovina, samt att utveckla och l&#xe4;mna in en ny programans&#xf6;kan till ambassaden i Sarajevo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a design support, i.e. a small support to the Swedish Gender Equality Agency for them to design a new program together with their sister agency in Bosnia and Herzegovina. The goal of the design support is to establish and find forms for in-depth cooperation between the Swedish Gender Equality Agency and its counterparts in Bosnia and Herzegovina, as well as to develop and submit a new program application to the embassy in Sarajevo.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To explore a partnership with the Agency for Gender Equality in Bosnia and Herzegovina (BiH) for mututal learning, institutional strengthening and capacity development, as well as enhancing gender equality and women&apos;s rights in BiH through comprehensive gender mainstreaming and technical assistance.

Expected results: 
- A joint, comprehensive programme proposal and its submission to Sida. 
- Established modalities and scope of agency-to-agency collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
